OL,3,ACould the earliest weakening of the
OL,4,Apolar vortex on record bring UK snow?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHigh above the Arctic, powerful winds
OL,7,Fusually circle the North Pole each
OL,8,Fwinter, helping trap some of the
OL,9,Fcoldest air on Earth.
OL,11,FBut this circulation, known as the
OL,12,Fpolar vortex, has weakened and shifted
OL,13,Fposition in recent days.
OL,15,FWhile such disruptions can occur during
OL,16,Fwinter, scientists say an event this
OL,17,Fearly in November is unprecedented in
OL,18,Fmodern observations.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
