OL,3,ACould the earliest weakening of the
OL,4,Apolar vortex on record bring UK snow?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSimilar disruptions in past years have
OL,7,Fsometimes been followed by colder
OL,8,Fweather affecting parts of Europe and
OL,9,FNorth America.
